5T36D5Zr0QMQ7kNvwGxLqm_&_nc_oc=Adr2-4t_8O5_WDtPUrU4WFUP2YJYZOfapF6gagmzFITVkT2FL17m4XT0Jqbm0thOiuI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEe5yHHo8f1ekSiL-OXTx1dpY7kkLtZccg4P0sKyQEPXg&oe=6A7F22B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G6aG7YEb_7gQ7kNvwHrbqww&_nc_oc=AdqBknN7LLlVph9_D1pPQ1rNOtT-suLlgHCI3Lb2WiZRqXVR2Kr2PaTJaZY_sB3LImQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH7mdvRRJiuAypwil_p2HTEX_4kcKdIoXMQLSjm7ha0Tg&oe=6A7F244A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HnAfa9lD8ngQ7kNvwH-bM8D&_nc_oc=AdrFLYY16Hp_B9FujlFp4NC_7GI-doLDWy9sNz_o4hvmyyMxdskNCCz63-NKQWxnuZo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHZWnhb8WFZ_ySu2KFx5tQAqvuU9atotv-FS5sZ4EYF9A&oe=6A7F116F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7YTTOO98qQsQ7kNvwHIFKeF&_nc_oc=AdqcZtnxQ0fHMtnwVs1VWrfL3rRppYn4UDz41rsUmCRvC31JyslJ0zMNyqDb_GjzeKI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFfo8hl93ekjR5udQUwLoj8dx9YEz2J-pSxd9oA4LnOFg&oe=6A7EFAC3"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WCTsg1lwb9MQ7kNvwGZq39X&_nc_oc=Adrgmx6j02lyeKusRPx8fI8rgUIbs3o4HtJmtHKnqbJlBAoACcMCFPl4dREoOZ0Dp7E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHu30vs4B9YuabqaOO3XPrq_P0LSe3bWSK5Mbg98MrCBQ&oe=6A7F2B58"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Kkk7Nm_X7TsQ7kNvwHt96Fk&_nc_oc=Adr8sPyVHo-Gw9_PhWmNpdsObPigAqfmwYVSGkjdI5neUM3KQY3MZMefLyDiJQwZ3NM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFUsHfZX-bgXt_hTG6py3SgH5pEv8WIBeF3sNK-uamz-Q&oe=6A7F063C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080